Now I pick up a skirt.
It is a cotton skirt.
Its colour is bright yellow.
This yellow skirt is very beautiful.
I put on this skirt.
I look at myself in the mirror.
This skirt looks very good on me.
Its size is also absolutely right.
I like this yellow skirt very much.
Then I look at the skirt's tag.
I read its price.
Oh my, it is very expensive!
Three thousand rupees is written on the tag.
This is too much for me.
I do not buy it.
I feel a little sad.
I take off this beautiful skirt.
I put it aside.
Now I pick up the next thing.
